 "note": "L, 18 platforms, 3v3, inward. Three homes a side. The middle home's front is an X junction feeding both pockets and the middle platform; the centre is a six-way roundabout (Junction_Hub6) fed from the middle platforms and the top platforms, which are gates drawing up their spoke and their bridge to the middle in one go. The survivor ring keeps the lane platforms too, so all six players have producers at the end. Mirrored left / right.",
